{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/VariantProtocol\/normalForm"},"abstract":[{"text":"Gets a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Variant"},{"type":"text","text":" instance that has the same value as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value"},{"text":" and is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"trusted to be in normal form.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"normalForm"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/VariantRef","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:4GLib10VariantRefV","text":"VariantRef"},{"text":"! { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value"},{"type":"text","text":" is already trusted to be in normal form then a new"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"reference to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value"},{"type":"text","text":" is returned."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value"},{"type":"text","text":" is not already trusted, then it is scanned to check if it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"is in normal form.  If it is found to be in normal form then it is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"marked as trusted and a new reference to it is returned."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is found not to be in normal form then a new trusted","type":"text"},{"